<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' ws://127.0.0.1:*; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/style.css"><title>__TITLE_HTML__</title></head>
<body><main class="shell"><header><span class="brand">GYEOL <span>/ WEB PLAY STUDIES</span></span><nav class="gyeol-row" aria-label="Game navigation"><button id="home" class="gyeol-action quiet" hidden>Menu</button><button id="pause" class="gyeol-action quiet" hidden>Pause</button><label class="file-button import-control" for="import">Import trail<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label></nav></header>
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">A SMALL ROUTE. A COMPLETE CIRCUIT.</p><h1>__TITLE_HTML__</h1><p class="description">Wake every amber node, then carry the signal home.</p></section>
<div id="screens">
<section id="menu" data-gyeol-screen class="gyeol-panel menu-panel" aria-labelledby="menu-title"><div class="gyeol-stack"><p class="eyebrow">01 — CIRCUITS</p><h2 id="menu-title">A path worth finding.</h2><p>One signal. Three sleeping nodes. Find a route that brings the whole field to life.</p><div class="menu-nodes" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span></span><i></i><span></span><i></i></div><div class="gyeol-row"><button id="continue" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Continue circuit</button><button id="start" class="gyeol-action primary">Start circuit ↗</button><span class="menu-note">Arrow keys or pointer · no time limit</span></div></div><ol class="gyeol-stack"><li><b>01</b><span>Move to a neighbouring open tile.</span></li><li><b>02</b><span>Wake all three amber nodes.</span></li><li><b>03</b><span>Reach the green terminal. Keep your trail.</span></li></ol></section>
<section id="play" data-gyeol-screen class="play-layout" aria-label="Play circuit" hidden inert><section class="game-panel" aria-label="Game"><div class="board-caption"><span>FIELD 01</span><span id="phase">Ready to connect</span></div><canvas id="board" width="720" height="400" tabindex="0" aria-label="Signal board. Use arrow keys to move or click an adjacent tile."></canvas><div class="hud"><div><span class="metric-label">NODES</span><strong id="nodes">0 / 3</strong></div><div><span class="metric-label">MOVES</span><strong id="moves">00</strong></div><button id="restart" class="gyeol-action">Restart circuit ↗</button></div></section>
<aside><h2>Find the connection.</h2><p>Move along the open paths. Light all three nodes before entering the green terminal.</p><div class="legend"><span><i class="node amber"></i> Wake the node</span><span><i class="node green"></i> Bring it home</span></div><p class="controls"><kbd>↑</kbd><br><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd><br><span>Arrow keys · or click a neighbour</span></p><div class="trail"><h3>Your trail</h3><p>Keep a route. Play it back, move for move.</p><button id="replay" class="gyeol-action" disabled>Replay trail</button><button id="export" class="gyeol-action" disabled>Export trail</button></div></aside></section>
<section id="result" data-gyeol-screen class="gyeol-panel result-panel gyeol-stack" aria-labelledby="result-title" hidden inert><p class="eyebrow">ALL THREE NODES AWAKE</p><h2 id="result-title">Connection complete.</h2><p>You found your way home in <strong id="result-moves">0</strong> moves.</p><div class="gyeol-row"><button id="again" class="gyeol-action primary">Play again ↗</button><button id="result-replay" class="gyeol-action secondary">Replay trail</button><button id="result-export" class="gyeol-action secondary">Export trail</button></div><p class="menu-note">Try a different route, or keep this one to play back later.</p></section>
</div>
<dialog id="pause-dialog" class="gyeol-dialog gyeol-panel" aria-labelledby="pause-title"><p class="eyebrow">TAKE YOUR TIME</p><h2 id="pause-title">Circuit paused.</h2><p>Your route is right where you left it.</p><div class="gyeol-stack"><button id="resume" class="gyeol-action primary">Resume circuit</button><button id="pause-restart" class="gyeol-action secondary">Restart circuit</button><button id="pause-menu" class="gyeol-action secondary">Return to menu</button></div><p class="menu-note">Escape to resume</p></dialog>
<section id="progress-panel" class="progress-panel" aria-label="Saved progress"><p id="save-status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="gyeol-row"><button id="save-progress" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Save progress</button><button id="save-retry" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Retry save</button><button id="save-backup" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Restore backup</button><button id="save-download" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Download stored data</button><button id="save-reset" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Reset saved progress</button><button id="save-reload" class="gyeol-action secondary" hidden>Reload stored progress</button></div></section><dialog id="reset-progress-dialog" class="gyeol-dialog gyeol-panel" aria-labelledby="reset-title"><h2 id="reset-title">Reset saved progress?</h2><p>This removes this device’s saved circuit and its backup. Download stored data first if you want to keep it. Your replay files are separate.</p><div class="gyeol-stack"><button id="cancel-reset" class="gyeol-action primary">Keep saved progress</button><button id="confirm-reset" class="gyeol-action secondary">Delete saved progress</button></div></dialog>
<p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite">Start when you are ready. There is no time limit.</p><footer><span>THINK IN PATHS.</span><span>A standalone Gyeol Engine web study</span></footer></main><script type="module" src="/src/main.ts"></script></body></html>
